AltoMarket::setFeeRecipient
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is owner
    ├── it should update feeRecipient
    ├── it should emit SetFeeRecipient event
    ├── when feeRecipient is zero address and borrowOpeningFee is greater than zero or IRM is set
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when feeRecipient is zero address and protocolFeePercentage is greater than zero
        └── it should revert